{"id":"43c81e33a22655f0","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-grothendieck-construction.md","title":"严格索引范畴的总范畴","display":"df-grothendieck-construction — 严格索引范畴的总范畴","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-grothendieck-construction","aliases":["16-df-grothendieck-construction","Split Grothendieck construction","16-grothendieck-construction"],"display":"df-grothendieck-construction — 严格索引范畴的总范畴","depends_on":["[[16-df-category]]","[[16-df-functor]]","[[16-df-split-fibration]]"],"source":"Definition 1.4.4(ii), p. 51 (PDF 71); Definition 1.10.1 and Proposition 1.10.2(i), pp. 107–108 (PDF 127–128)","revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-grothendieck-construction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-grothendieck-construction</span><span>Split Grothendieck construction</span><span>16-grothendieck-construction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-grothendieck-construction — 严格索引范畴的总范畴"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"25a281534aa42440\" href=\"?note=25a281534aa42440\" title=\"16-df-category\">16-df-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fc49efccd7348d66\" href=\"?note=fc49efccd7348d66\" title=\"16-df-functor\">16-df-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"eb3d8d8bfc151af6\" href=\"?note=eb3d8d8bfc151af6\" title=\"16-df-split-fibration\">16-df-split-fibration</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Definition 1.4.4(ii), p. 51 (PDF 71); Definition 1.10.1 and Proposition 1.10.2(i), pp. 107–108 (PDF 127–128)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>固定足够大的宇宙 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\\in\\mathcal W\">\\(\\mathcal V\\in\\mathcal W\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span>-小范畴。所有构造在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal W\">\\(\\mathcal W\\)</span> 中编码，范畴采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"25a281534aa42440\" href=\"?note=25a281534aa42440\" title=\"16-df-category\">16-df-category</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F=(F_0,F_1)\">\\(F=(F_0,F_1)\\)</span> 为候选索引记录；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_1\">\\(F_1\\)</span> 是以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal B\">\\(\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal B\\)</span> 为定义域的函数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F(I)\">\\(F(I)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F(u)\">\\(F(u)\\)</span> 分别简写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_0(I)\">\\(F_0(I)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_1(u)\">\\(F_1(u)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StrictIndexed}(F,\\mathcal B)\">\\(\\mathrm{StrictIndexed}(F,\\mathcal B)\\)</span> 由下文定义；后续构造以满足该谓词的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 为参数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=(I,X)\">\\(A=(I,X)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B=(J,Y)\">\\(B=(J,Y)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C=(K,Z)\">\\(C=(K,Z)\\)</span> 表示下文 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O_F\">\\(O_F\\)</span> 的对象。总箭头显式携带源靶标签 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle A,B,u,f\\rangle\">\\(\\langle A,B,u,f\\rangle\\)</span>；在源靶已给定的 Hom 记号中简写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(u,f):A\\to B\">\\((u,f):A\\to B\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cat}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cat}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Functor}\">\\(\\mathrm{Functor}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p,\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p,\\kappa)\\)</span> 分别采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"25a281534aa42440\" href=\"?note=25a281534aa42440\" title=\"16-df-category\">16-df-category</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fc49efccd7348d66\" href=\"?note=fc49efccd7348d66\" title=\"16-df-functor\">16-df-functor</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"eb3d8d8bfc151af6\" href=\"?note=eb3d8d8bfc151af6\" title=\"16-df-split-fibration\">16-df-split-fibration</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{StrictIndexed}(F,\\mathcal B)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\nF_0:\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B\\to\\{\\mathcal C\\in\\mathcal V\\mid\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathcal C)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall u\\in\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal B)\\\n\\mathrm{Functor}(F_1u,F_0(tu),F_0(su))\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\\\nF_1(\\operatorname{id}_I)=\\operatorname{Id}_{F_0I}\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall(v,u)\\in M^{(2)}_{\\mathcal B})\\\nF_1(vu)=F_1u\\circ F_1v.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{StrictIndexed}(F,\\mathcal B)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\nF_0:\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B\\to\\{\\mathcal C\\in\\mathcal V\\mid\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathcal C)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall u\\in\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal B)\\\n\\mathrm{Functor}(F_1u,F_0(tu),F_0(su))\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\\\nF_1(\\operatorname{id}_I)=\\operatorname{Id}_{F_0I}\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall(v,u)\\in M^{(2)}_{\\mathcal B})\\\nF_1(vu)=F_1u\\circ F_1v.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nO_F&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(I,X)\\mid I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B\n\\land X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}F(I)\\},\\\\\nM_F&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle A,B,u,f\\rangle\\mid\nA=(I,X)\\in O_F\\land B=(J,Y)\\in O_F\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{35mm}\\land u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal B}(I,J)\n\\land f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{F(I)}(X,F(u)Y)\\},\\\\\ns_F\\langle A,B,u,f\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq A,\n\\qquad t_F\\langle A,B,u,f\\rangle\\coloneqq B,\\\\\ne_F(A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle A,A,\\operatorname{id}_I,\\operatorname{id}_X\\rangle,\\\\\nc_F(\\langle B,C,v,g\\rangle,\\langle A,B,u,f\\rangle)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle A,C,vu,F(u)g\\circ f\\rangle,\\\\\n\\textstyle\\int F&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle O_F,M_F,s_F,t_F,e_F,c_F\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nO_F&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(I,X)\\mid I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B\n\\land X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}F(I)\\},\\\\\nM_F&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle A,B,u,f\\rangle\\mid\nA=(I,X)\\in O_F\\land B=(J,Y)\\in O_F\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{35mm}\\land u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal B}(I,J)\n\\land f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{F(I)}(X,F(u)Y)\\},\\\\\ns_F\\langle A,B,u,f\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq A,\n\\qquad t_F\\langle A,B,u,f\\rangle\\coloneqq B,\\\\\ne_F(A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle A,A,\\operatorname{id}_I,\\operatorname{id}_X\\rangle,\\\\\nc_F(\\langle B,C,v,g\\rangle,\\langle A,B,u,f\\rangle)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle A,C,vu,F(u)g\\circ f\\rangle,\\\\\n\\textstyle\\int F&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle O_F,M_F,s_F,t_F,e_F,c_F\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n(p_F)_0(I,X)&amp;\\coloneqq I,\n\\qquad(p_F)_1\\langle A,B,u,f\\rangle\\coloneqq u,\n\\qquad p_F\\coloneqq\\langle(p_F)_0,(p_F)_1\\rangle,\\\\\n\\kappa_F(u,(J,Y))&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\langle(I,F(u)Y),(J,Y),u,\\operatorname{id}_{F(u)Y}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\textstyle\\int F)&amp;,\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Functor}(p_F,\\textstyle\\int F,\\mathcal B),\n\\qquad\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p_F,\\kappa_F).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n(p_F)_0(I,X)&amp;\\coloneqq I,\n\\qquad(p_F)_1\\langle A,B,u,f\\rangle\\coloneqq u,\n\\qquad p_F\\coloneqq\\langle(p_F)_0,(p_F)_1\\rangle,\\\\\n\\kappa_F(u,(J,Y))&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\langle(I,F(u)Y),(J,Y),u,\\operatorname{id}_{F(u)Y}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\textstyle\\int F)&amp;,\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Functor}(p_F,\\textstyle\\int F,\\mathcal B),\n\\qquad\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p_F,\\kappa_F).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StrictIndexed}\">\\(\\mathrm{StrictIndexed}\\)</span> 显式展开严格函子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B^{\\mathrm{op}}\\to\\mathbf{Cat}\">\\(\\mathcal B^{\\mathrm{op}}\\to\\mathbf{Cat}\\)</span>，避免依赖未构造的“大范畴 Cat”。这里 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_1\">\\(F_1\\)</span> 是以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal B\">\\(\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal B\\)</span> 为定义域的函数，函子类型条件逐输入确定其值。</li>\n<li>箭头不能仅编码为裸二元组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(u,f)\">\\((u,f)\\)</span>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F(u)\">\\(F(u)\\)</span> 不在对象上单射，相同 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u,f\">\\(u,f\\)</span> 可能对应不同靶对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span>。显式源靶标签使六元组的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_F,t_F\">\\(s_F,t_F\\)</span> 单值。</li>\n<li>严格函子定律给出单位、结合律。所选提升的因子问题归结为纤维中的因子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span>，它唯一等于待分解箭头的纤维分量；提升严格保持恒等与复合，故得到指定分裂 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa_F\">\\(\\kappa_F\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, Definition 1.4.4(ii), p. 51（PDF 71）；Definition 1.10.1、Proposition 1.10.2(i), pp. 107–108（PDF 127–128）的严格情形。一般非严格 cleavage 的版本见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d8e49782eb81e5ab\" href=\"?note=d8e49782eb81e5ab\" title=\"16-df-grothendieck-total-category\">16-df-grothendieck-total-category</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"25a281534aa42440","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"fc49efccd7348d66","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-split-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"eb3d8d8bfc151af6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-split-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"25a281534aa42440","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定足够大的宇宙 $\\mathcal V\\in\\mathcal W$；$\\mathcal B$ 为 $\\mathcal V$-小范畴。所有构造在 $\\mathcal W$ 中编码，范畴采用 [[16-df-category]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"25a281534aa42440","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cat}$、$\\mathrm{Functor}$、$\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p,\\kappa)$ 分别采用 [[16-df-category]]、[[16-df-functor]]、[[16-df-split-fibration]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"fc49efccd7348d66","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cat}$、$\\mathrm{Functor}$、$\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p,\\kappa)$ 分别采用 [[16-df-category]]、[[16-df-functor]]、[[16-df-split-fibration]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-split-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"eb3d8d8bfc151af6","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cat}$、$\\mathrm{Functor}$、$\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p,\\kappa)$ 分别采用 [[16-df-category]]、[[16-df-functor]]、[[16-df-split-fibration]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-grothendieck-total-category","status":"resolved","id":"d8e49782eb81e5ab","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"来源：Jacobs, Definition 1.4.4(ii), p. 51（PDF 71）；Definition 1.10.1、Proposition 1.10.2(i), pp. 107–108（PDF 127–128）的严格情形。一般非严格 cleavage 的版本见 [[16-df-grothendieck-total-category]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal V\\in\\mathcal W","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal W","display":false},{"tex":"F=(F_0,F_1)","display":false},{"tex":"F_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"F(I)","display":false},{"tex":"F(u)","display":false},{"tex":"F_0(I)","display":false},{"tex":"F_1(u)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StrictIndexed}(F,\\mathcal B)","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"A=(I,X)","display":false},{"tex":"B=(J,Y)","display":false},{"tex":"C=(K,Z)","display":false},{"tex":"O_F","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle A,B,u,f\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"(u,f):A\\to B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cat}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Functor}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p,\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{StrictIndexed}(F,\\mathcal B)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\nF_0:\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B\\to\\{\\mathcal C\\in\\mathcal V\\mid\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathcal C)\\}\\\\\n&\\land(\\forall u\\in\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal B)\\\n\\mathrm{Functor}(F_1u,F_0(tu),F_0(su))\\\\\n&\\land(\\forall I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\\\nF_1(\\operatorname{id}_I)=\\operatorname{Id}_{F_0I}\\\\\n&\\land(\\forall(v,u)\\in M^{(2)}_{\\mathcal B})\\\nF_1(vu)=F_1u\\circ F_1v.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nO_F&\\coloneqq\\{(I,X)\\mid I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B\n\\land X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}F(I)\\},\\\\\nM_F&\\coloneqq\\{\\langle A,B,u,f\\rangle\\mid\nA=(I,X)\\in O_F\\land B=(J,Y)\\in O_F\\\\\n&\\hspace{35mm}\\land u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal B}(I,J)\n\\land f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{F(I)}(X,F(u)Y)\\},\\\\\ns_F\\langle A,B,u,f\\rangle&\\coloneqq A,\n\\qquad t_F\\langle A,B,u,f\\rangle\\coloneqq B,\\\\\ne_F(A)&\\coloneqq\\langle A,A,\\operatorname{id}_I,\\operatorname{id}_X\\rangle,\\\\\nc_F(\\langle B,C,v,g\\rangle,\\langle A,B,u,f\\rangle)\n&\\coloneqq\\langle A,C,vu,F(u)g\\circ f\\rangle,\\\\\n\\textstyle\\int F&\\coloneqq\\langle O_F,M_F,s_F,t_F,e_F,c_F\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n(p_F)_0(I,X)&\\coloneqq I,\n\\qquad(p_F)_1\\langle A,B,u,f\\rangle\\coloneqq u,\n\\qquad p_F\\coloneqq\\langle(p_F)_0,(p_F)_1\\rangle,\\\\\n\\kappa_F(u,(J,Y))&\\coloneqq\n\\langle(I,F(u)Y),(J,Y),u,\\operatorname{id}_{F(u)Y}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\textstyle\\int F)&,\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Functor}(p_F,\\textstyle\\int F,\\mathcal B),\n\\qquad\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p_F,\\kappa_F).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StrictIndexed}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B^{\\mathrm{op}}\\to\\mathbf{Cat}","display":false},{"tex":"F_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"(u,f)","display":false},{"tex":"F(u)","display":false},{"tex":"u,f","display":false},{"tex":"Y","display":false},{"tex":"s_F,t_F","display":false},{"tex":"h","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa_F","display":false}],"bytes":3833,"backlinks":[{"id":"3af0cd796b55bbd7","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"07a1592023f10b9f","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"固定足够大的宇宙使本页的 $\\mathbf{Eff}$、$\\mathbf{PER}$ 及族范畴可按小范畴编码；大小层次与 [[16-df-grothendieck-construction]] 一致。$A=(I,\\rho)\\in\\mathbf{Eff}$，$E(i)=\\rho(i,i)$、$I_0=\\{i\\in I\\mid E(i)\\ne\\varnothing\\}$；$\\Gamma A$ 及只在 $I_0$ 上使用的 $[i]$ 采用 [[16-df-effective-global-sections]]。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-254","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-grothendieck-construction|df-grothendieck-construction — 严格索引范畴的总范畴]]"},{"id":"68817150a3172cfd","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{StrictIndexed}(F,\\mathcal B)$，$\\int F,p_F,\\kappa_F$ 采用 [[16-df-grothendieck-construction]]；$I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B$。"},{"id":"d384d77e035108ca","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cat}$、$\\mathrm{Functor}$、$\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p,\\kappa)$ 分别采用 [[16-df-category]]、[[16-df-functor]]、[[16-df-split-fibration]]；$\\mathrm{StrictIndexed}(F,\\mathcal B)$ 采用 [[16-df-grothendieck-construction]]。"}],"outgoing":["25a281534aa42440","fc49efccd7348d66","eb3d8d8bfc151af6","d8e49782eb81e5ab"]}